   "title": "AI stocks halt brutal, worldwide sell-off as Wall Street trims its loss for the week",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/world/20261107/ai-stocks-halt-brutal-worldwide-sell-off-as-wall-street-trims-its-loss-for-the-week",
