   "title": "[COVER STORY] Ruling party leader's credibility put on line as Shincheonji claims backfire",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/southkorea/politics/20261107/cover-story-ruling-party-leaders-credibility-put-on-line-as-shincheonji-claims-backfire",
