   "title": "Russia Pounds Power Facilities Around Kyiv, Damages Major Bridge",
   "url": "https://www.themoscowtimes.com/2026/11/07/russia-pounds-power-facilities-around-kyiv-damages-major-bridge-a94198",
   "domain": "themoscowtimes.com",
