   "title": "Tokenising government securities could attract more foreign investors to Ghana",
   "url": "https://www.myjoyonline.com/tokenising-government-securities-could-attract-more-foreign-investors-to-ghana-wewire-ceo/",
   "domain": "myjoyonline.com",
