   "title": "Tinubu, two African presidents to attend as Nigeria hosts 126 countries for World Public Relations Forum",
   "url": "https://www.premiumtimesng.com/news/more-news/923303-tinubu-two-african-presidents-to-attend-as-nigeria-hosts-126-countries-for-world-public-relations-forum.html",
   "domain": "premiumtimesng.com",
   "source": "Premium Times（尼日利亚）",
   "published": "Sat, 07 Nov 2026 08:06:15 +0000",
