   "title": "Sonia Gandhi’s memoir to revisit love, loss and her decision to decline India’s top job",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/sonia-gandhis-memoir-to-revisit-love-loss-and-her-decision-to-decline-indias-top-job/article71360236.ece",
