   "title": "Korea, Netherlands hold 1st joint committee meeting on science, technology",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/foreignaffairs/20261106/korea-netherlands-hold-1st-joint-committee-meeting-on-science-technology",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
