   "_dt": 1793944623.0,
   "ageDays": 1.24,
   "summary": "Science ministries from Korea and the Netherlands held the first joint committee meeting on science and technology in the central city of Sejong on Friday and discussed a range of topics from investment plans to policy discussions on artificial intelligence and scientific research. The event came after a memorandum of understanding (MOU) on research and science cooperation was signed between the two countries in 2024, the Ministry of Science and ICT said.",
   "summary_zh": "韩国和荷兰的科学技术主管部门周五在世宗特别自治市首次举行科学技术联合委员会会议，讨论了从投资计划到人工智能与科学研究政策等多项议题。韩国科学技术信息通信部表示，此次会议是在两国于2024年签署研究与科学合作谅解备忘录（MOU）之后举行的。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Science ministries from Korea and the Netherlands held the first joint committee meeting on science and technology in the central city of Sejong on Friday and discussed a range of topics from investment plans to policy discussions on artificial intelligence and scientific research. The event came after a memorandum of understanding (MOU) on research and science cooperation was signed between the two countries in 2024, the Ministry of Science and ICT said. Research management agencies from the two countries agreed to build joint research models in areas of mutual interest, while the Korean side proposed strengthening ties in the field of quantum technology and synthetic biology, according to the ministry. \"Building on the foundation of cooperation the two countries established in semiconductors, we were able to broaden the horizon to various advanced science technologies,\" the science ministry said, vowing to support future research collaboration between the two countries",
   "bodyLevel": "fulltext",
