   "title": "Tinubu has shown he cares about workers with ₦70,000 allowance",
   "url": "https://www.vanguardngr.com/2026/11/tinubu-has-shown-he-cares-about-workers-with-%e2%82%a670000-allowance-oshiomhole/",
