   "title": "Muslim candidates make history in US midterm elections",
   "url": "https://dailytrust.com/muslim-candidates-make-history-in-us-midterm-elections/",
   "domain": "dailytrust.com",
   "source": "Daily Trust（尼日利亚）",
   "published": "Fri, 06 Nov 2026 05:07:22 +0000",
