   "title": "Financial policymakers to monitor US AI, trade policies following election",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/economy/policy/20261105/financial-policymakers-to-monitor-us-ai-trade-policies-following-election",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
