   "title": "Korean Air sweeps 3 top honors at USA Today travel awards",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/business/companies/20261105/korean-air-sweeps-3-top-honors-at-usa-today-travel-awards",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
