   "ageDays": 2.4,
   "summary": "Unlock these with Subscription The dramatic results of the U.S. midterms will probably have less impact on India-U.S. bilateral relations than on geopolitics and, as a result, India’s “operating environment” in the world. Here are five areas where this will matter most to India. In interviews given after the results began to come in, Mr. Trump said he stood by his decision to attack Iran in February 2026, but acknowledged that Iran was “part” of the reason for Republican losses.",
   "summary_zh": "订阅即可解锁　美国中期选举的戏剧性结果对印美双边关系的影响，可能不及对地缘政治以及印度在世界上所处的“营商环境”的影响。以下五个领域对印度最为重要。在结果开始公布后进行的采访中，特朗普表示，他仍坚持2026年2月攻击伊朗的决定，但承认伊朗是共和党失利“部分”原因。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Account subscription benefits alongside Premium Stories, Editorials, Opinions and more. Unlock these with Subscription The dramatic results of the U.S. midterms will probably have less impact on India-U.S. bilateral relations than on geopolitics and, as a result, India’s “operating environment” in the world. The elections are likely to hand Democrats a sizable majority in the House of Representatives and a comfortable edge in the Senate, which means U.S. President Donald Trump will face restraints on both domestic and foreign policy. Here are five areas where this will matter most to India. In interviews given after the results began to come in, Mr. Trump said he stood by his decision to attack Iran in February 2026, but acknowledged that Iran was “part” of the reason for Republican losses. It isn’t clear whether this means he will give talks with Iran a greater chance and look for an early exit from the war, but New Delhi will watch closely. USA / Donald Trump / politics / election / India-United States Comments have to be in English, and in full sentences. They cannot be abusive or personal. Please abide by our community guidelines for posting your comments. We have migrated to a new commenting platform. If you are already a registered user of The Hindu and logged in, you may continue to engage with our articles. If you do not have an account please register and login to post comments. Users can access their older comments by logging into their accounts on Vuukle",
